# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Loop 2: the pylons

step Northern Pylon
  tip The pylon stands on the slope east of the refuge.
  goto 56.5,12.5 "Northern Crystal Pylon"
  interact 164955 quest 4285.1

step Gorillas
  tip The gorillas live on the north-east plateau. Stay out of the deepest cave: U'cha lives there.
  turnin 4243                         -- A-Me 01, the robot on the plateau; below ground
  note A-Me 01 then wants a Mithril Casing, an Engineering item. Skip it unless you have one.

step Un'Goro Crater: kill these as you meet them
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip Careful: Gorishi Workers may call for help within 25 yd when below 45% health; silithids cast Silithid Pox and Tunnelers and the Hive Guard use Tunneler Acid.
  collect 11018 quest 3761
  collect 11018 quest 4496.2

step Eastern Pylon
  tip Ride down the east side of the crater to the pylon on the eastern cliffs.
  goto 77.2,50.0 "Eastern Crystal Pylon"
  interact 164957 quest 4287.1

step The Marshlands
  tip Careful: There are many ravasaurs roaming the area, so you can easily pull several at the same time.
  tip Below level 52, keep hunting the ravasaurs here after the eighth claw: The Rise of the Machines at Kargath needs level 52, and the Plaguelands quests at the end of this guide are level 55. Or, with a group, run the Sunken Temple dungeon or the Maraudon dungeon instead.
  collect 11477 quest 4300
  level 52 grind 6505                 -- grind on Ravasaur

