  accept 4726                         -- Tinkee Steamboil
  turnin 4324                         -- Yuka Screwspigot

step Sha'ni Proudtusk
  tip Follow the cliffs south to Dreadmaul Rock, the Firegut ogres' hill. Sha'ni Proudtusk's remains lie at its foot.
  turnin 3821
  accept 3822

step Krom'Grul
  tip Krom'Grul walks the caves and mine tunnels of Dreadmaul Rock; if he isn't home, clear the ogres around the entrances until he comes back.
  collect 11058 quest 3822            -- Below ground

step Ruins of Thaurissan: kill these as you meet them
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Ride west to the dig site. War Reaver golems (53) stomp around it and drop the shards often; the Tablet of the Seven stands in its middle among the Thaurissan dwarves. Copy it.
  tip Black Broodlings nest in the hills just east of Flame Crest. Use Tinkee's Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 on a broodling when it is almost dead to capture its essence.
  collect 11266 quest 4061
  collect 12283 quest 4726 @81.0,28.0
  use 12284 quest 4726.1 @81.0,28.0 map 1428
  collect 11470 quest 4296 @54.1,40.8

