  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip The book lies in the ruined inn of Terrordale.
  tip The Large Termite Mounds stand all over the hills east of Terrordale. Use the Empty Termite Jar on each mound you pass.
  collect 15884 quest 6164 @17.4,31.1 -- Upstairs
  collect 15043 quest 5901

